window.products.push({"id":1121127,"name":"Coffee Mugs, 13 Oz Plain White Porcelain Mugs with Handle for DIY Paint,Dishwasher Safe, Microwave Safe, Chip-free, Lead-free (1 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XIQ0rBZ5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A Good Mug for Every Drink With clean, non porous porcelain, you can rest assured you'll have a wonderful drinking experience. You won't get the nasty flavors from the mug like you do with plastics or metals. Suitable for Any Occasion No matter what your favorite drink is or where you are, this mug will serve your purposes well. Good Quality and Design Made of premium porcelain, this mug is pure white with no stains or cracks. The bottom is completely flat and sturdy, so you don't have to worry about knocking it over. In addition, it's packaged securely, so you know it will arrive in perfect condition. Durable Even with Temperature Variations Are you afraid of being hurt by a cracked mug when you pour in hot water or coffee Our mugs are built to withstand temperature variations from cold to hot, so you will be safe from cracks. Specifications: Capacity: 13 Ounces Color: ivory white Material: premium porcelain Size: Height: 11.5cm Length: 11.5cm Width: 8cm What you get: 2 coffee mugs Warranty: 30 DAY QUALITY If anything goes wrong with the product within 30 days, we'll refund or replace the product for free. This excludes damage caused by human error. Tips: 1. While the mugs are microwave safe, they may become hot in the microwave, so handle them carefully. 2. Please keep the mug on a flat surface. 3. Please keep the package on a flat surface when you open it. 4. If you break a mug, please sweep the shards up with a broom instead of trying to pick them up by hand. 5. Always let your mug come to room temperature before going from cold to hot drinks or vice versa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XIQ0rBZ5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYTong","source_asin":"B083TDZ659","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083TDZ659","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083TDZ659","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
