window.products.push({"id":1121205,"name":"Homtone Induction Cooktop 30 inch 5 Burner, Built-in Induction Stove Top, 240V Electric Hob, 9 Heating Stage, Child Safety Lock, Sensor Touch Control,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":398.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xt7Upll8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Size] Drop-in 5 electric induction hob burners product size: 760x510x63mm / 30x20x2.48\", the built-in size: 710x480/28x18.9\". [5 Versatile Burner Cooktop] The electric induction stove holds 5 burning zones: 3x 2000W boost to 2300W, 2x 1500 W boost to 2800W, total maximum power reaching 9300W, can heat up faster and cook quicker. The 5 induction burners make time coordinated for delicious dishes can be prepared simultaneously. Note: Only use cookware with a suitable base for induction cooking. [Ceramic Glass Cooktop] The built-in electric cooktop is made of high quality vitro ceramic glass surface, heat-resistant and durable. The smooth black finish not only look incredibly attractive, it is also extremely convenient for cleanup. [9 Power Level] The electric hob has 9 power level for different cooking demands. Operated with digital sensor controller, press buttons with your finger pulp to select the desired temperature for expected cooking modes, such as searing, simmering, frying, boiling and so on. With 1-99 Minute Timer, You can set the timer to shutdown the induction cooker automatically. [Over-Temperature Protection] Induction cooker is loaded with over-temperature protection system, which will power-off automatically when an excessive temperature is monitored. The stove hob will also shut down automatically when you did not set cooking time, forgot to switch off the hob, and did not operate the hob at all. [Residual Heat Indicator & Child Lock] Electric hob is of residual heat indicator for each cooking zone, clear to see whether the plate has cooled down. The child lock on the electric cooktop discourage children from opening the induction hob by accident thus getting hurt. Homtone induction cooktop is certified by FCC and we provide a 12-month warranty for the gas cooktop, replace a new set directly once it has any quality problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xt7Upll8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homtone","source_asin":"B0B46CS7P7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B46CS7P7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B46CS7P7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
