window.products.push({"id":1121349,"name":"ZPECC Full Sheet Set-4 Piece Soft Bed Sheets Set-1800 Thread Count Breathable Bedding-100% Brushed Microfiber – Hypoallergenic – Wrinkle Resistant-Dee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxhesIoIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 PIECE BED SHEET SET: ZPECC 4-piece full sheet set includes 1 Full Fitted Sheet (54\" x 75\" x 16\" pocket), 1 Full Flat Sheet (81\" x 96\") and 2 Standard Pillowcases (20\" x 30\"). SUPER SOFT & SKIN-FRIENDLY: Our bed sheet sets are made of 1800 Thread Count materials to keep your sleep Comfy, Clean, Cozy. Our premium bed sheets enhance the comfort level of any bed! DEEP POCKETS & EASY FIT: Fits mattresses up to 16\" deep. It fits so well that you don't have to worry about how it will loosen up in bed. Available in a variety of colors and sizes for you to choose from. Great for your family and friends! EASY TO CLEAN & USE: All these bed sheets are machine washable, anti-wrinkle, and unfading. Here are some tips for washing these bed sheets: please cold wash and tumble dry low, no bleach, no iron, and no dry clean. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE: Suitable for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home. Great gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day, and Christmas. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us and we’ll reply as soon as we can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VxhesIoIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZPECC","source_asin":"B08XVZ7P35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVZ7P35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVZ7P35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1121350,"name":"Paralegal Coffee Mug. Paralegal gift 11 oz. black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514OmifascL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Creativity: Buy awesome Paralegal coffee mug for the one you know, the one you work with or the one with you are related to! The unique and funny coffee or tea cup is a great way to express your love and gratitude towards your special one. That special one may be your friend, parent, better half, colleague, your boy or girl friend. It doesn’t a matter. Creative gifts will be liked by all. Best Quality: We will do our best and will supply you with a high quality ceramic mug. All ceramic cups are dishwasher and microwave safe with with large easy grip handle. The imprinted is printed on both sides of the mug and guaranteed to last. 100% total and complete satisfaction guaranteed! Unique and funny: There are only few things that have the power to connect people from all around the world. Coffee is one such thing. This unique Paralegal mug is a great occasion to discuss a lot with just a cup of coffee in our hands. Nothing can make people happier than holding a cup of hot coffee with some uncommon coffee mugs. So gifting the funny coffee mugs is a great idea to make them remember you with every sip they take. Stylish: Hold a stylish and awesome coffee mug in your hand, you make a stylish statement in a silent way. Get the unique custom coffee cups with unforgettable title I'm a paralegal What's your superpower? , add to your collection and show how awesome you are. Memorable: Unique and Funny coffee mugs are intended for coffee lovers and also for all who enjoy the quality of art. When you buy our personalized coffee mug to someone, either they will preserve it to their collections or they will find a cup of coffee for themselves. Whatever it may be they will remember you every morning. Design:W137","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514OmifascL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderful Mugs","source_asin":"B06Y4BG69Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y4BG69Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y4BG69Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
