window.products.push({"id":1121353,"name":"Star Registry Name A Star Black Deluxe Star Kit with Photographic Sky Image","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":158.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513Z8QxqdeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hitch your name to a star. It's a personalized gift that will never be forgotten. For centuries, we have been told to look to the stars. For 40 years International Star Registry has brought those dreams to Earth. When you buy a star package to name a star for someone with International Star Registry, your name will join a constellation of celebrities, dignitaries, and even royalty, plus over 3 million honored individuals worldwide. Perfect for Weddings, Anniversaries, Baby Gifts, Birthdays, Christmas, Hanukkah, Memorial Remembrance, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine’s Day, or any special occasion. Name a star! Each unique star is named only once and will be permanently recorded in the book \"Your Place in the Cosmos\" which will be copyrighted for future generations to refer to and enjoy. Do you have a friend who loves all things related to the zodiac and horoscope? What a perfect gift for someone who follows their horoscope daily. Are you looking for a gift for someone who loves to gaze at the heavens, or perhaps foster a child’s interest in the science of astronomy? Whatever your reason, a permanent marker of a life well lived, a gift of romance and sentiment, or a source of ongoing inspiration, name a star with International Star Registry and be a part of the only published catalog of star names in the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513Z8QxqdeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Star Registry","source_asin":"B07G8MDFNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G8MDFNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G8MDFNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
