window.products.push({"id":1121481,"name":"Old Fashioned Whiskey Glass Set, Premium Rocks Glasses for Cocktails and Bourbon, 10 1/4 Oz, Set of 6, Lead-Free Crystal, Bar Drinking Glass Tumbler f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G4fQ2-ozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY LOWBALL GLASSES (SET OF 6): Gorgeous rock style old fashioned cocktail glasses are made with only the finest materials. Perfect for serving scotch, whiskey, vodka, bourbon, liquor, cocktail, juice or mixed drinks. Makes an elegant addition to your dinner table or home bar. LEAD-FREE EUROPEAN CRYSTAL: Scotch glasses does not contain harmful elements such as lead for safe drinking. Lead-free crystal not only safe for drinking but refracts more light than ordinary wiskey glasses, so you can see your drinks more clearly. Do not compare with Made in China glasses ELEGANT DESIGN: The classic style makes whiskey tumbler a perfect addition to your barware collection or for daily use. Traditional style crafted with a heavy base clean, straight lines. Sturdy & Durable. It is dishwasher safe. Each can hold up to 305 cc (10 ¼ OZ) Irish whiskey, wine, bourbon, scotch, juice, and other mixed drinks. Height: 93 mm (3 3/4 \"). Standard Size, feel comfortable with your hands, not too small for ice cube PERFECT GIFT: Crystal whiskey glass set is an excellent gift for any occasion. The perfect gift for Christmas, Birthday, Wedding Anniversary, Valentine's day, Father's day, Mother's day, Housewarming, College Graduation, St. Patrick's day, Job Promotion, and secret Santa gifts! RISK FREE PURCHASE: For the long and complicated shipping processes, if the products you received are broken, please contact us ASAP. We guarantee to offer you a replacement. We believe in our packaging quality","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G4fQ2-ozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Volarium","source_asin":"B0C5JVHL2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5JVHL2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5JVHL2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
