window.products.push({"id":1121531,"name":"LiyuanQ Wine Bottle Lights with Cork, 15 Pack Battery Operated Cork Lights + 9 PCS Extra Replacement Batteries with Fairy Mini String Lights for Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eqt-T-TEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Glass Bottles Lights】 Made of high-quality ultra thin copper wire, LiyuanQ Wine Bottle Cork Lights can be bended easily, 360 degrees sparkle with beautiful effect, don't easily break off, perfect cork light for wine bottles, glass bottles, beer bottles and collecting liquor bottles etc. Good for diy decorations wedding party dinner table Halloween Christmas and etc, even a great wine bottle lights with cork for many other projects or crafts of all led decoration. 【Easy to Use and Install by Bottle Lights】Powered by 3 PCS LR44 batteries (include), 48 hours of battery life, don't need to screwdriver to open the battery case, don't need to go to shop to buy batteries and screwdriver. The batteries are replaceable, the led bottle light would be reused for many times. Easy to use, just take out the insulation and switch the button to turn on/off the light and enjoy these amazing fairy lights. 【Batteries Powered】Every wine bottle cork light is powered by 3 PCS LR44 batteries (batteries already Installed all 30) and 9 PCS complimentary replacement batteries included. With the waterproof wire lights(The cork body is not waterproof), it is absolutely safe even if the bottle has some water. Low-heating, no worry about overheating for long time using. The low heat emission and eco-friendly design bottle cork string lights could create romantic warm atmosphere after decoration. 【Widely used】Made of High-quality ultra thin copper wire. These bottle cork string lights are functional and decorative, they can make a waste wine bottle into a home craft decor. Cork shaped lights make the bottles romantic, shining and beautiful. Widely used for Christmas Halloween party wedding barbecue bar etc. It is also a good gift for your friends and families. 【Universal Size】The cork has the most universal size, which is suitable for various bottles, such as glass bottles ,beer bottles ,soda bottles, great for creating the romantic atmosphere. Most Popular Warm White Lights, 10 Super Bright Led Bulbs on a 40 Inches Long and Thin Copper Wire. (Bottle not Included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eqt-T-TEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiyuanQ","source_asin":"B07W5WF5PX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W5WF5PX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W5WF5PX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
