window.products.push({"id":1121558,"name":"Digital Kitchen Timer Rotation Countdown Timer Pro Magnetic Countup Timer with 3-Level Volume Adjustable Large Led Display for Study/Exercise/Cook/Bak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j8zOrtdML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"⭐【Ultra Clear Led Display & Easy to Read】The digital timer features 3.2 inches large black screen and white bold digits numbers displayed allow old folks with bad eyesight clearly see the time remaining. Premium ABS and aluminum Materials make this timer more durable. A great kitchen timer for mothers cooking, baking, egg boiling, making coffee, or grilling steak/teacher organization for classroom, games, etc. 📣【NO Worry About Overcook or Being Too Noisy】The digital kitchen timer counter with 3 levels of volume adjustable, Loud alarm (80-90dB) Can hear this alarm in another room; soft volume (60-75dB) is much better when used by kids to protect their hearing; silent mode(no volume), blink led digital number will remind you when time arrival; You can adjust the timer volume to meet your needs. ⏳【Easy to Use for The Elderly and Kids】Upgraded version digital kitchen timer with two Counting Mode and Memory Functionone, one-button operation, just twist the knob to set the time, easy to set. Digital timers count down from 99 minutes 55 seconds to zero, or as a stopwatch counting up from zero to 99 minutes 55 seconds. Support counting up and down. Besides, the magnetic timer can memorize the last use set until it is cleared. 🧲【Make Easier to Cook】80° Angle Adjustable and Magnetic Base. Magnetic kitchen timer can be adjusted within 0-80 degrees to meet wherever you need. Powerful magnets base design, which is powerful suction and no-slip, you can stick to the refrigerator, classroom whiteboard, cooker, students tablet, iron wall, sports gym or any metal surface, make your phone No Longer Oily. 😊【What You Get】Magnetic Digital timer*1, User manual*1, warranty card*1, (For environmental protection, without battery, Need 3*AAA batteries). The heyo rotation countdown timer only has 105g, is Palm-sized, easy to carry. Best outdoor timer ever for BBQ! Baseus devote to customer satisfaction and provide technical support and service, 45-Day money-back, 24-hour friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j8zOrtdML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baseus","source_asin":"B09FXYTYNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FXYTYNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FXYTYNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
