window.products.push({"id":1121569,"name":"HMIN Quiche Pan Removable Bottom Tart Pan Include A 9.4-Inch And Six 4-Inch Tart Pans, Non-Stick Carbon Steel Loose Bottom Tart Pans Set of 7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Ew4o5kiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The tart pans are manufactured with carbon steel and premium non-stick coating, food safe, good quality, will not bend out of shape. The non-stick coating is non-toxic, durable, endure high-temperatures and heavy use. The tart pans have removable bottom, which can help you easily demold, if you brush some oil on the tart pan before using, you will get better demolding effect. There are 2 different sizes, the small size (4 inch) are suitable for baking quality of tart, small size cake, and the large size (9.4 inch) fits to bake big cake or pizza, It is fun for your baking with your family especially with your kids. Specifications: Material: Carbon Steel  Colour: Black Product Size: Shown as Picture  Box Size: 9.8\"×9.8\"×1.2\"or 25cm×25cm×3cm(approx.) Weight: 1.36pound or 620g (approx.) Package Included(7 pcs): 1 *9.4Inch tart pan 6 *4Inch tart pans Note: Please allow 1-2cm errors due to manual measurement. Item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different on your computer monitor since monitors are not calibrated same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Ew4o5kiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HMIN","source_asin":"B08HCNX8RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCNX8RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCNX8RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1121570,"name":"Roundabouts Cupcake Sleeves Treasure Chest Cupcake Sleeve (Pack of 24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711cSBD-JZL._SL1353_.jpg","description":"Kids young and old will enjoy hunting for these treasures. Simply wrap the Roundabouts Cupcake Sleeve around your cupcake and top with all manner of edible treasures. Make fun, unforgettable cupcakes instantly without special baking or decorating skills. The sleeve does all the work and you get all the credit. These special adhesive sleeves hold tight even in moist, refrigerated air and are manufactured using solvent-free inks, so designs won't bleed with food oils and grease. Best of all, these patented sleeves are grease resistant, which means frosting mistakes wipe right off! These are not your typical paper cupcake wrappers which sit loosely around a cupcake – Roundabouts sleeves transform cupcakes into a dramatic cylinder shape and turn your plain cupcakes into one-of-a-kind works of art. Fits standard-sized cupcakes (or wrap tighter for mini's).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711cSBD-JZL._SL1353_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roundabouts Cupcake Sleeves","source_asin":"B009XIN0QG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009XIN0QG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009XIN0QG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1121571,"name":"Madison Park Essentials Parkston Plaid Comforter, Matching Sham, 3M Scotchguard Stain Release Cover, Hypoallergenic All Season Bedding-Set, Full/Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m8VKp7igL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Madison Park Essentials Parkston 3M Scotchgard Down Alternative All Season Comforter Set offers a classic and cozy update for your bedroom with a dark gray, black, and white plaid print.The comforter features 3M Scotchgard moisture management treatment to help wick away moisture, keeping you dry and comfortable. Piping along the edge of the comforter and matching shams add dimension and charm to the bedding set. The hypoallergenic down alternative filling provides extra comfort, while the sewn-through box-quilting prevents the filling from shifting, providing an even distribtuion of warmth. Machine washable for easy care, this ultra soft microfiber comforter set is perfect for sprucing up your bedroom. Set includes: 1 Comforter and 2 Shams (or 1 Sham for Twin sizes).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m8VKp7igL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park Essentials","source_asin":"B073RDQH13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073RDQH13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073RDQH13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
