window.products.push({"id":1121580,"name":"Küchenprofi Stainless Steel Tomato Corer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vAoOvDHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Founded in Solingen Germany by Artur Schmitz in 1923, the story of Kuchenprofi is one of diligence, innovation and refinement. Early on, Kuchenprofi realized the need for affordable functional tools that make the kitchen more efficient and more enjoyable. The name of Kuchenprofi reflects strength, quality and functionality demanded by chefs around the world. Kuchenprofi made for professionals, now available to anyone passionate about cooking. Coring tomatoes for canning is a time-consuming chore. until now. In the blink of an eye, Kuchenprofi's restaurant-style Tomato Corer scoops out the core - and ONLY the core - leaving the rest of the juicy-ripe tomato intact. Tiny toothed scooper works great on strawberries, too. Just grasp the comfort-grip handle and give it a twist. Durable, gleaming stainless steel won't react with tomato acids or impart a metallic taste. Dishwasher safe. 5-inch long","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vAoOvDHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchenprofi","source_asin":"B000NLLVJU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NLLVJU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NLLVJU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
