window.products.push({"id":1121583,"name":"CandleTEK Wall Sconces with Flameless Candles, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61taaf1lnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double the worry-free candlelit ambiance. Battery-operated and equipped with a convenient timer setting, this set of two handcrafted, traditional-style metal wall sconces brings brilliant convenience to your home decor. Includes two sconces with integrated flameless candles. Black finish with copper-colored edge detail. 4- or 8-hour timers. Each requires 3 AAA batteries, not included. Measurements: Sconce 8\"H x 4-1/2\"W; Candle 7-7/8\"H x 2\"Diam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61taaf1lnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CandleTEK","source_asin":"B00KH6RXI4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KH6RXI4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KH6RXI4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1121584,"name":"GermGuardian AC4175W 4-in-1 Air Purifier, True HEPA Filter UV-C Light Sanitizer, Traps Dust, Pet Dander, Smoke, Pollen, Quiet 3-Speed Tabletop Tower, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T0plbFEWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 4-in-1 Air Purifier with HEPA Filter is recommended to use in small rooms. It's compact tabletop design fits ideal for offices, bedrooms, nurseries, kitchens, laundry rooms, and more! The HEPA filter captures 99.97% of airborne particles such as dust, pollens, mold spores, debris and pet dander while the activated carbon layer helps reduce common household odors caused by bacteria, smoke, pets and cooking fumes. More than just a filter, the UV-C light helps reduce airborne bacteria, viruses, mold spores* and works with Titanium Dioxide to reduce volatile organic compounds. Choose from 3 speeds, including a low speed that runs ultra-quiet. The simple and stylish 11\" design looks great in any home environment. CADR Dust (50), Pollen (50) and Smoke (42). *Tested with Staphylococcus Albus, and Escherichia Coli, Aspergillus Niger, and Phi-X174.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T0plbFEWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GermGuardian","source_asin":"B09YMJGS5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YMJGS5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YMJGS5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1121585,"name":"Rosanna Rococo Noir Black Small 8.25-Inch Cake Pedestal, Gift-boxed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lIYhbfmpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Like a better-than-basic black dress, this collection steps right out off the runway in the strongest color the season. Reminiscent of the exuberant style of the mid-18th century, it sets the stage for accessorizing with gold, silver, platinum, white ¿ or anything you please. This collection is made of sturdy stoneware, it is microwave, and dishwasher safe. Amazon.com Rosanna borrows the dainty detailing and plentiful use of curves from 18th-century French Rococo arts to create her modern-day Rococo Noir tableware. The collection's ornate teapot, sugar and creamer set, and pedestal cake stands are executed in sturdy stoneware and glazed a deep, shiny black that elegantly accessorizes some of her other patterns. For Christmas dining, Rococo Noir pairs perfectly with the new Rosanna Haute Holiday pattern, which features such silhouettes in black as Santa's sleigh and a reindeer on a red-and-white ground. Throughout the year, use the solid black Noir to accent Rosanna's decorative black-and-white Parisian Wallpaper collection. Black adds drama to any table setting. Measuring nine inches in diameter, this cake stand is the smallest size of the three in the collection. A scalloped edge adorns the perfectly flat top, while the pedestal base itself is shaped with facets and a decorative ball. The two larger cake stands may be stacked with this one to create a three-tiered buffet centerpiece with a strong wow factor. After the last crumb is gone, the pedestal cake platter can be placed in the dishwasher, although because of its shape hand-washing may be the better bet. Rosanna packages the cake stand in a round gift box comprised of a gold-and-white brocade-patterned top and a black base, almost as impressive as the piece itself. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lIYhbfmpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosanna","source_asin":"B000TK8AFI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TK8AFI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TK8AFI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
