window.products.push({"id":1121684,"name":"Coffee Tables for Living Room, Grey Coffee Table with 2 Baskets Storage, Modern Farmhouse Coffee Table with Reinforced Tabletop, Rustic Industrial Sma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wUlkznIuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ No Shaking: Compared with others, we specially added 4 Side Panels under the panel as support.It reinforces the stability of the coffee table and ensures that it does not shake during daily use. ☕ 2 Storage Baskets: Two foldable storage rattan baskets are provided to expand your storage space and keep all your items handy, organized and clean. The baskets are designed with imitated rattan, which is beautiful and durable. You can use them to store CDs, toys, snacks, handicrafts, books and more. ☕ Modern Coffee Table:Industrial-style metal corners and X-shaped frame create a unique industrial look for the coffee table.Simple, smooth lines combined with an elegant wooden look make the coffee table a perfect match for any living room. ☕ Dual Shelves Design: With a double-layer storage shelf design, this coffee table meets your multi-purpose use. You can eat, work, and study on the top desktop, and the spacious lower shelf provides enough storage space for your magazines, books, vases, etc. ☕ Easy Assembly: The simple structure of the coffee table and detailed assembly instructions ensure that you can assemble all the parts quickly and easily. Two foldable baskets can be assembled easily in one step, and when you don’t need them, they can also be folded without taking up your space. Any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wUlkznIuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LGHM","source_asin":"B099KLDZFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1121684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KLDZFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KLDZFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
